<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuanian consumer prices up 1.1 pct in November.</title>
<headline>Lithuanian consumer prices up 1.1 pct in November.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuanian monthly inflation in November rose 1.1 percent compared to 0.1 percent in October for a year on year increase of 15.0 percent, the country's Statistics Department said on Thursday.</p>
<p>CONSUMER PRICE INDEX</p>
<p> (Percent change)	     Nov 96	  Oct 96	Nov 95</p>
<p> Month on month		 +1.1	    +0.1	  +4.3</p>
<p> Year on year		   +15.0	   +18.6	 +37.2</p>
<p> Index (Dec 1993=100)	 220.6	   218.2	 191.8</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +371 7211 5240</p>
